# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A lost sibling call leaves the split waiting under its gate forever.
MODULE: ForegroundSiblingCallLost
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreground split awaits a SetPrevSiblingAsync call that was never sent
PERTURBS: ForegroundCallSibling

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "sib"
    /\ sib = "none"
    /\ sib' = "queued"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "sib"
    /\ sib = "none"
    \* MUTATION: the call is never sent
    /\ sib' = "none"
--- END
